==Description==
The '''Shrimp Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 29 of the regular [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{BeachBalls|980}} or {{Robux|70}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|13,490}} or {{Robux|2,261}}. This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|88}} with a total cost of {{Robux|2,842}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a total cost of {{Robux|2,240}}.

The '''Shrimp Nametag''' has light orange text with an orange outline. Shrimp appear float around the nametag.

